url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-17430](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17430)\n### Description\n\nTServers refresh or acquire a new ysql lease by sending the `RefreshYsqlLease` RPC. While the master leader is handling this RPC, is it possible for other lock / unlock RPCs to come in and be forwarded to the tserver sending the `RefreshYsqlLease` request. #27735 is a bug for the special case when the tserver has not yet bootstrapped its local lock manager and receives a release lock request before receiving its very first `RefreshYsqlLease` response.\n\nThis race can also happen more generally on lease re-acquisition. Consider:\n\n1. TServer X loses its ysql lease.\n2. X sends a `RefreshYsqlLease` to the master leader.\n3. The master leader processes the `RefreshYsqlLease` request, marks X as having a live lease, and writes the locks for A to bootstrap to the response. This set of locks includes a lock on object O.\n4. The master leader receives a release request for locked O.\n5. The master leader forwards the release request for O to tserver X.\n6. X processes the release request.\n7. X receives the response to its `RefreshYsqlLease` request. It recreates its local lock manager, acquiring a lock on all locks in the bootstrap payload including O.\n\nAt this point the lock on O has been leaked on tserver X. Further DDLs on O are blocked until X loses and re-acquires its lease, or the lock on O is manually released.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-17430]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17430?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/27829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/27829/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":18396603559,"node_id":"LE_lADOBlCVUc685weyzwAAAARIheSn","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/18396603559","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-06-30T23:16:29Z","label":{"name":"2025.1 Backport Required","color":"CA0798"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":18476075474,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBlCVUc685weyzwAAAARNQonS","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/18476075474","actor":{"login":"druzac","id":865068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTA2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/865068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac","html_url":"https://github.com/druzac","followers_url":"https://ap